# What must never appear in a commit message: session links, local paths.
# One extended regular expression per line, matched case-insensitively;
# lines starting with # are comments. Read by .githooks/commit-msg and
# .github/scripts/commit_hygiene.py. E-mail addresses are checked separately:
# only noreply addresses are allowed.
^Claude-Session:
claude\.ai/
session_01[A-Za-z0-9]{8}
/home/[A-Za-z]
/Users/[A-Za-z]
/tmp/claude-
scratchpad
